SUMMARY:The Sun Kings at The California Theatre
DESCRIPTION:Experience The Sun Kings\, America’s premier Beatles tribute\, bringing the concert The Beatles never gave.\nCelebrate the timeless music of The Beatles with The Sun Kings\, one of the nation’s most acclaimed tribute bands. Now in their 25th year\, The Sun Kings deliver the hits and deep cuts with stunning accuracy\, blending spot-on harmonies\, authentic instrumentation\, and electrifying stage presence.\nFrom “She Loves You” to “Abbey Road\,” The Sun Kings recreate the magic of the Fab Four with a passion that’s won them praise from critics and fans alike. Don’t miss this unforgettable evening of music that captures both the spirit and sound of The Beatles\, live\, as you’ve never heard them before. \nDoors open at 6:00pm. Show at 7:00pm. \nThis event uses Zoned Seating:\nSeats within each zone are first-come-first-served. Ushers will seat you within your chosen zone upon arrival. (Zone C does not guarantee a seat.)\nCheck ticket descriptions for details\, & scroll down for a general zone chart. \nZONE A: $37.\nZONE B: $30.\nZONE C: $23.\nTickets at the door (Zone C only): $37 \nOur kitchen is open and serving our All New Menu from the time doors open until end of intermission for events with more than 60 pre-sale tickets.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/the-sun-kings-at-the-california-theatre/
LOCATION:The California Theatre of Santa Rosa\, 528 7th Street\, Santa Rosa\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/02/The-Sun-Kings.jpg
GEO:38.44252;-122.71621
