SUMMARY:Leading Ladies - Play
DESCRIPTION:Directed by Amanda Claiborne \nSponsored by Dobie Edmunds\, Lee Hunt & Joan Meisel \nIn this hilarious comedy\, two English Shakespearean actors\, Leo and Jack\, find themselves down on their luck. \nBut then\, what luck! They hear that dear old Florence is about to die and leave her fortune to her two long lost English nephews whom she has never seen. For Jack and Leo it is the work of an instant to turn themselves into nephews Max and Steve and grab the cash. And that’s when the complications set in… \nRomantic entanglements abound\, as Some Like It Hot meets Twelfth Night in this screwball comedy filled with bad behavior\, high heels and a world of comedy.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/leading-ladies-play-2/
LOCATION:Cloverdale Performing Arts Center\, 209 N. Cloverdale Blvd.\, Cloverdale\, CA
CATEGORIES:Comedy,Theater
