SUMMARY:Sonoma County Wildfire and Earthquake Expo 2026
DESCRIPTION:The Sonoma County Wildfire & Earthquake Expo is a free\, family-friendly event designed to help kids and families learn how to stay safe and prepared during emergencies. Taking place on April 26\, 2026\, at the Sonoma County Event Center\, the Expo features hands-on activities\, interactive exhibits\, and engaging demonstrations led by first responders\, local agencies\, and community organizations—making emergency preparedness fun\, approachable\, and empowering for all ages.
