SUMMARY:We the Sculptor - International Sculpture Day(s)
DESCRIPTION:Ten Sonoma County sculptors will gather at the T Barny Gallery and Sculpture Gardens on April 25 & 26 from 11 AM to 4 PM to celebrate International Sculpture Days with an event titled We The Sculptors. (https://sculpture.org/page/isday ) Their works range from Ceramics to Stone\, and Steel to Zipties.\nThis year’s event embraces the belief that sculpture can inspire\, provoke\, and challenge the world around us. Visitors can engage in acts of “defiant dissidence\,” exploring how art can serve as both personal reflection and public voice.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/we-the-sculptor-international-sculpture-days/2026-04-26/
