SUMMARY:Apple Blossom Festival
DESCRIPTION:Parade down main street Saturday morning from 10am – noon.\nFestival Hours:\nSaturday 11:00 AM- 6:00 PM\nSunday 11:00 AM- 6:00 Pm\nThis year’s theme\, “The Blossoms of OZ\,” pays homage to the magical wonder of our local landscape and the timeless charm of a classic journey. Attendees can anticipate a lively parade featuring authentic handmade floats\, amazing animals\, and colorful displays along the yellow brick road of Sonoma County. \nThe festival will also showcase a lineup of bands\, a variety of delicious food options\, arts and crafts vendors\, and numerous activities for children.The Apple Blossom Festival was initiated in 1947 by George E. Keefe\, Jr.\, as a springtime event to celebrate Sebastopol’s rich agricultural heritage and the beauty of apple blossoms in spring. \nOver the decades\, it has evolved into a cherished tradition\, featuring parades\, live music\, artisan displays\, and family-friendly activities\, drawing visitors from near and far to partake in the festivities. \nPresale tickets are now available. Tickets at the gat
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/apple-blossom-festival/
LOCATION:Ives Park\, 7400 Willow Street\, Sebastopol\, CA
CATEGORIES:Festival
ATTACH;FMTTYPE=image/jpeg:https://golocal.coop/wp-content/uploads/2026/04/Apple-blossom-parade-festival-2026-s.jpg
