SUMMARY:Festival Dia del Nino
DESCRIPTION:Festival Día del Niño is a free\, family-friendly community event that celebrates children through culture\, education\, and entertainment. The festival brings together live performances\, interactive activities\, community resources\, and local vendors to create a fun and meaningful experience for families. Our mission is to inspire and support children while strengthening community connection in Sonoma County. Our Talent: Ballet Folklorico Netzahualcoyotl\, Ballet Paquiyollotzin\, Payasito Javiercito\, Los Magos de CA\, Banda Puerto Escondido\, Him do Kwan Taekwondo\, Marimba & more!
