SUMMARY:Americana Afternoon: Local Legends & Rising Stars
DESCRIPTION:Local legends & rising stars unite! Folk\, Americana\, fiddle\, and originals in one unforgettable afternoon\nJoin us for an afternoon of music with Sonoma County favorites Ken Risling and Doug Jayne. Ken performs with his children\, Avery and Oona\, as The A-OKs—an eclectic trio blending 70s throwbacks\, Scottish fiddle\, and original songs with a warm folk/Americana sound. \nDoug Jayne\, a local music legend\, is joined by Cori Wood and Tim Sarter for a rich mix of Americana\, roots\, and genre-spanning performances. It’s a dynamic lineup celebrating local talent and timeless sounds. \nDoors Open: 12:30 PM | Show Starts: 1:00 PM\nTickets $17 in advance. $25 at door
