SUMMARY:Pazifico at Rio Nido Roadhouse
DESCRIPTION:Pazifico is a Sonoma County–based rock reggae band blending elements of reggae\, rock\, hip-hop\, and funk into a laid-back but high-energy sound rooted in Northern California’s live music scene. Formed in 2020\, the group focuses on original music and has quickly built a presence playing venues across the North Bay. \nThe band features Isaiah Lopez (vocals\, guitar)\, Nick Heimer (bass)\, Julio Gomez (lead guitar)\, Jeff Sipes (drums and percussion)\, and Clay Grosskopf (DJ)\, combining live instrumentation with rhythmic grooves and modern influences. \nKnown for their enthusiastic performances and genre-blending style\, Pazifico brings a “Cali reggae” vibe that’s both relaxed and danceable\, making them a staple at local venues and community events throughout Sonoma County. \nCatch Pazifico live at Sunday Social at the Roadhouse for an afternoon of original music\, good energy\, and North Bay flavor.
URL:https://golocal.coop/event/pazifico-at-rio-nido-roadhouse/
LOCATION:Rio Nido Roadhouse\, 14540 Canyon 2 Road\, Rio Nido\, CA
CATEGORIES:Music
